+/* Scan for wineserver socket in WINEPREFIX/.wineserver/<host>/socket.
+ * poll_sec: 0=single check; >0=poll N seconds (200ms intervals)
+ * vanish_mode: 0=socket must appear; 1=socket must NOT vanish
